OL,3,GNEWSAPupils warned not to skip school  
OL,4,Ato play GTA 6                          
OL,6,FSchools have sent warnings to parents  
OL,7,Fnot to let their children take time off
OL,8,Fto play the newly released video game, 
OL,9,FGrand Theft Auto VI.                   
OL,11,FThe game, also known as GTA 6 was      
OL,12,Freleased in the UK at midnight, with   
OL,13,Fpeople booking the day off work to     
OL,14,Fenjoy the open-world streets of the    
OL,15,Ffictional Vice City and break the law. 
OL,17,FSchools in Bristol and Gloucestershire 
OL,18,Fhave sent emails and messages of       
OL,19,Fconcern to parents and reminded them   
OL,20,Fthe game is intended for adults not    
OL,21,Fchildren due to its content.           
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
