OL,3,GNEWSAPupils warned not to skip school  
OL,4,Ato play GTA 6                          
OL,6,FUniversity of the West of England games
OL,7,Ftechnology expert Lloyd Savickas said  
OL,8,Fhis team built the game's release into 
OL,9,Fassessment calendars and said it will  
OL,10,Fhave a far reaching "cultural impact". 
